          "section_anchor": "S3.2 Gesundheitspsychologie",
          "printed_page": 27,
          "physical_page": 27
        },
        "cited_text": "Transaktionales Stressmodell von Lazarus und Folkman (Co-\npingstrategien) \n• Salutogenesekonzept von Antonovsky (Kohärenzsinn)",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Stress management approaches include Meichenbaum's stress inoculation training, Kaluza's stress management program and mindfulness trainings.",
